    "readme_description": "The string `\"PAYPALISHIRING\"` is written in a zigzag pattern on a given number of rows like this: (you may want to display this pattern in a fixed font for better legibility)\n\n```\nP   A   H   N\nA P L S I I G\nY   I   R\n```\n\nAnd then read line by line: `\"PAHNAPLSIIGYIR\"`\n\nWrite the code that will take a string and make this conversion given a number of rows:\n\n```\nstring convert(string s, int numRows);\n```",
